# _Duty: natural death (transition from critical to dead without gib/suicide/one-shot)

# IC emotes for nearby bystanders (format: "<Name> <line>").
duty-natural-death-emote-1 = shudders faintly, lets out a final breath, and goes limp...
duty-natural-death-emote-2 = gives a weak rattle as the last tension leaves their body...
duty-natural-death-emote-3 = exhales one last shallow breath and falls completely still...
duty-natural-death-emote-4 = lets out a quiet, ragged sigh and fades into stillness...

# Subtle popups for the dying player as perception fades.
duty-natural-death-self-1 = A final breath slips from your lips...
duty-natural-death-self-2 = The last of your strength leaves you...
duty-natural-death-self-3 = Everything around you slowly fades into silence...

# Popup shown if trying to ghost out immediately during the brief fadeout window.
duty-natural-death-ghost-locked = Consciousness is still fading...
